<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="tr">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <title>eca.shopping</title>
  <style>
    body {
      font-family: Arial, sans-serif;
      background: #f5f5f5;
      margin: 0;
      padding: 0;
      text-align: center;
    }
    .container {
      padding: 40px 20px;
      max-width: 600px;
      margin: auto;
      background: white;
      border-radius: 12px;
      box-shadow: 0 4px 10px rgba(0,0,0,0.1);
    }
    img {
      max-width: 100%;
      border-radius: 8px;
    }
    h1 {
      margin: 20px 0 10px;
      color: #333;
    }
    p {
      color: #666;
    }
    .button {
      display: inline-block;
      padding: 12px 24px;
      margin-top: 20px;
      font-size: 16px;
      background-color: #e1306c;
      color: white;
      border: none;
      border-radius: 6px;
      text-decoration: none;
      transition: background 0.3s ease;
    }
    .button:hover {
      background-color: #c42a61;
    }
    footer {
      margin-top: 30px;
      color: #888;
      font-size: 14px;
    }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <div class="container">
    <img src="https://i.imgur.com/4R5nLkK.jpg" alt="Katlanabilir Telefon Standı">
    <h1>Katlanabilir Telefon Standı</h1>
    <p>Minimal tasarım, maksimum işlev! Her yerde rahatça kullanabileceğiniz dayanıklı, taşınabilir telefon standı.</p>
    <p><strong>Fiyat:</strong> 69 TL</p>
    <a href="https://instagram.com/eca.shopiing" target="_blank" class="button">Hemen Sipariş Ver (Instagram)</a>
    <footer>
      @eca.shopiing ile iletişime geçin ❤️
    </footer>
  </div>
</body>
</html>
